  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41699636",
      "title": "Introducing & Using Render Props",
      "sourceHash": "18e9ddec79c589b0e27251826b90ffdd7090f355ca0b2e2e3d3af0ad227e912b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.65,
          "en": "Now that we explored Compound Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.65,
          "end": 6.87,
          "en": "in depth, it's time to move on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.87,
          "end": 9.48,
          "en": "to another important React pattern,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.48,
          "end": 12.45,
          "en": "and that would be the render props pattern.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.45,
          "end": 15.273,
          "en": "But what's that pattern all about?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.59,
          "end": 20.07,
          "en": "Well, the core idea behind this render props pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.07,
          "end": 25.07,
          "en": "is that you pass a function as a value for the children prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.56,
          "end": 27.84,
          "en": "or actually for any prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.84,
          "end": 31.83,
          "en": "but it's most commonly done for the children prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.83,
          "end": 34.05,
          "en": "So the idea is that you have one component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.05,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "that defines some function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 40.62,
          "en": "which important, must return something renderable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.62,
          "end": 44.58,
          "en": "So a function in a component where that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.58,
          "end": 47.943,
          "en": "in the component then returns something renderable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.96,
          "end": 52.59,
          "en": "and it's then this function which is passed as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.59,
          "end": 54.66,
          "en": "for the children prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.66,
          "end": 58.65,
          "en": "So between those component tags to another component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.65,
          "end": 63.65,
          "en": "component two, and that component then returns the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.93,
          "end": 66.54,
          "en": "of calling that received function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.54,
          "end": 71.103,
          "en": "which is why this function must return something renderable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.45,
          "end": 73.47,
          "en": "Sounds weird?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.47,
          "end": 75.78,
          "en": "Well, let's take a look and let's also take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.78,
          "end": 78.963,
          "en": "at when you might wanna use this pattern.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.37,
          "end": 83.34,
          "en": "Now I'm back in that project from before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.34,
          "end": 84.78,
          "en": "and now I want to build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.78,
          "end": 89.28,
          "en": "a new reusable SearchableList component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.28,
          "end": 90.821,
          "en": "which should be a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.821,
          "end": 94.11,
          "en": "that displays a search input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.11,
          "end": 97.5,
          "en": "and contains the logic for searching through the items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.5,
          "end": 99.57300000000001,
          "en": "that are passed to that list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.59,
          "end": 103.02000000000001,
          "en": "And the idea is that this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.02000000000001,
          "end": 105.84,
          "en": "can be used on different kinds of data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.84,
          "end": 107.55,
          "en": "and very important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.55,
          "end": 110.64,
          "en": "that this component is all about containing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.64,
          "end": 112.11,
          "en": "that search logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.11,
          "end": 114.84,
          "en": "but not really about controlling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.84,
          "end": 116.85300000000001,
          "en": "how the items should be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.81,
          "end": 122.13,
          "en": "So I wanna build a component that contains a lot of logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.13,
          "end": 124.503,
          "en": "possibly also some complex logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.46,
          "end": 128.19,
          "en": "but that's not really involved too much",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.19,
          "end": 132.48,
          "en": "with rendering the items that are searchable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.48,
          "end": 136.323,
          "en": "And that's a use case where render props can help us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.22,
          "end": 140.19,
          "en": "So for that here, I'll add another new folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.19,
          "end": 143.04,
          "en": "in the Components folder in that existing project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.04,
          "end": 145.313,
          "en": "and I'll name it SearchableList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.12,
          "end": 150.843,
          "en": "And then in that folder I'll add a SearchableList.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.57,
          "end": 156.72,
          "en": "which will export component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.72,
          "end": 159.633,
          "en": "called SearchableList, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.13,
          "end": 164.01,
          "en": "Now, this SearchableList component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 164.01,
          "end": 168.06,
          "en": "should then receive the items that should be searchable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 168.06,
          "end": 170.643,
          "en": "so the list items that should be searchable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 171.63,
          "end": 176.31,
          "en": "and then it should return div, let's say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.31,
          "end": 181.31,
          "en": "with a className of searchable-list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 181.32,
          "end": 184.5,
          "en": "which is a CSS class I already defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.5,
          "end": 188.13,
          "en": "in the starting project to give us some basic styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 188.13,
          "end": 191.47,
          "en": "And then in that div, I wanna have an input of type search",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 193.41,
          "end": 197.253,
          "en": "with a placeholder text of search, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 198.27,
          "end": 201.573,
          "en": "And then below that input, I wanna have an unordered list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 202.44,
          "end": 205.14,
          "en": "And we'll then output the items down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.14,
          "end": 208.05,
          "en": "And for the moment, I'll do that by mapping every item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.05,
          "end": 209.04,
          "en": "to a list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 209.04,
          "end": 212.19299999999998,
          "en": "though we'll change that later, as explained.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 213.93,
          "end": 217.11,
          "en": "For the moment, I'll just use the item as a key then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.11,
          "end": 222.11,
          "en": "and then output the item here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 224.04,
          "end": 227.55,
          "en": "Again, this part will change later though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 227.55,
          "end": 230.76,
          "en": "But with that we can go back to the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 230.76,
          "end": 234.36,
          "en": "and in there, below that accordion stuff here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 234.36,
          "end": 237.73,
          "en": "let's say we can add another section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 239.16,
          "end": 243.21,
          "en": "where I wanna use my SearchableList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 243.21,
          "end": 246.213,
          "en": "And for that, of course, you should import that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 247.38,
          "end": 250.62,
          "en": "And for the moment, we can use it as a self-closing tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 250.62,
          "end": 255.033,
          "en": "and simply set items to some random items of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 256.47,
          "end": 259.56,
          "en": "Now, here for this project, I prepared some items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 259.56,
          "end": 262.02,
          "en": "and attached you find a link to a file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 262.02,
          "end": 264.6,
          "en": "that contains such a PLACES constant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 264.6,
          "end": 266.673,
          "en": "which contains a bunch of dummy data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 268.05,
          "end": 272.61,
          "en": "And it's now this Places dummy data, which I'll pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 272.61,
          "end": 276.453,
          "en": "as a value to items, PLACES written like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 277.95,
          "end": 280.3,
          "en": "And then we could also output another instance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 280.3,
          "end": 284.013,
          "en": "of that SearchableList and output some other data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 285.3,
          "end": 290.3,
          "en": "for example, an array of simple strings like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 293.28,
          "end": 295.23,
          "en": "So I'm using the same component twice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 295.23,
          "end": 296.613,
          "en": "to output different data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 297.57,
          "end": 299.67,
          "en": "Now, for that Places data to work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 299.67,
          "end": 302.43,
          "en": "you should then also add a bunch of other imports,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 302.43,
          "end": 304.92,
          "en": "which you also find in that attached file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 304.92,
          "end": 308.403,
          "en": "to import the images that belong to those places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 309.84,
          "end": 313.59,
          "en": "Now, with that done, we have two SearchableLists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 313.59,
          "end": 316.38,
          "en": "and therefore, if we reload the app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 316.38,
          "end": 319.35,
          "en": "we'll actually be greeted by an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 319.35,
          "end": 322.203,
          "en": "that we have two children with the same key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 323.28,
          "end": 326.91,
          "en": "So what I'll do for the moment to fix this problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 326.91,
          "end": 331.2,
          "en": "is actually get hold of the index of the specific item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 331.2,
          "end": 335.793,
          "en": "and use that as a key, just as a temporary solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 336.72,
          "end": 338.7,
          "en": "In addition, to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 338.7,
          "end": 341.7,
          "en": "that we can actually see something on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 341.7,
          "end": 344.61,
          "en": "even if we're trying to output an entire object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 344.61,
          "end": 346.74,
          "en": "as it will be the case for Places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 346.74,
          "end": 348.99,
          "en": "which is an array of objects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 348.99,
          "end": 353.193,
          "en": "I will actually call toString here on item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 354.24,
          "end": 357.39,
          "en": "Again, this is also just a temporary solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 357.39,
          "end": 360.48,
          "en": "but with that, we see something on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 360.48,
          "end": 364.71,
          "en": "not the final result, of course, but we see something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 364.71,
          "end": 367.65,
          "en": "And before we'll improve what we see here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 367.65,
          "end": 369.81,
          "en": "I actually wanna work on that search logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 369.81,
          "end": 372.423,
          "en": "and make sure that we add that to SearchableList.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}